sum	night 2: LIGHT_SLEEP real - shadow - · target real rem 1 shadow rem 1 · hits real 1/1
sum	all: 2 nights, 2 with reference · LIGHT_SLEEP real 0/1 shadow - · target real rem 1 shadow rem 1 · hits real 1/2
